  "notes": "A recap-and-preview format broadcast: after tonight's three matches, the show previews that Sunday's Survivor Series '95 card in full -- CCW World Heavyweight Champion Ric Flair vs. Shawn Michaels, CCW Intercontinental Champion 2 Cold Scorpio vs. Bret \"Hitman\" Hart, a Texas Death Match (loser retires) pitting Hulk Hogan against Sabu, CCW United States Champion Sting vs. Hunter Hearst-Helmsley, a tag team elimination match (Razor Ramon & the 123 Kid vs. Raven & Cactus Jack), CCW Tag Team Champions the Public Enemy vs. Harlem Heat, Taz vs. a mystery opponent, and the Steiner Brothers vs. Kama & Sid -- none of which the held record's single surviving document shows contested."
